    - target: {fileID: 3819461241045042490, guid: d1196da97cc726d48bb5c44c053d9cef,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: '<i>Weapon Notes : </i>


        - Weapons can be configured with infinite
        ammo, physical reload, or timer.


        - Press A / X to Release Slide.
        Press B / Y to eject clips.


        - Ammo Capacity is 1:1 with magazine
        size : bullets are removed from the clip for each shot.


        - You can
        grab ammo from your waist holster when you have a weapon equipped

'
