      value: "<i>Demo Notes : </i>\n\nClick Left Thumbstick to toggle between Teleport
        and Smooth Locomotion.\n\nClick Right Thumbstick to cycle through different
        hand models.\n\nHold X to enter Slow Motion\n\nYou can equip items by dropping
        them in the rings near your waist and on your shoulders.\n\nCheckout beardedninjagames.com/vr-framework/
        for docs, tutorials, support, and more. \n\nHave fun!"
